    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> bjorn3 created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14788#discussion_r4301979249\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This reloc allows the linker to patch an entire sequence of instructions, not just the 4 bytes of the relative address.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 632494448,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
